-- A DATETIME as an input and as a result. `l4 batch` wrote the result as an
-- object, {"timezone": ..., "utc": ...}, which neither it nor JSONDECODE reads
-- back (smucclaw/l4-ide#1085); it writes RFC 3339 in UTC.

TIMEZONE IS "Asia/Singapore"

@export default The moment itself
GIVEN w IS A DATETIME
GIVETH A DATETIME
`moment` MEANS w

#EVAL `moment` (DATETIME_FROM_DTZ (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 1 2026) (TIME_FROM_HMS 10 30 0) "UTC")
